        "description": "Reads Bellmont Regional Medical Center&#39;s plain-language guide from the hospital database: prescription words and abbreviations in everyday words, pickup locations, appointment types, what to say while a pharmacist is still reviewing a medicine, reading-level rules and the safety-net sentence. Rows of section, term, meaning. Read-only reference data with no patient data. Pass term &quot;&quot; for the whole guide.",
        "links": [
